Cell["\<\
Discontinuity at dG = 0.1, tP=28, \[Phi]=0, goes to 0 at \[Theta] = \[Pi]/2
Discontinuity when tP >> dG for \[Theta] = \[Pi]/2, but only when \[Phi] is \
not \[Pi]/2 
Same discontinuity for any value of tP and dG. Example: dG = 4.65, tP = 11.3, \
\[Phi] = 1.55, \[Theta] = 1.0 \
\>", "Text",
